        {
          "text": "Khona-ke u-Eliyakimi indodana kaHilikiya, owayephethe indlu, noShebina unobhala noJowaki indodana ka-Asafa, umbusi, beza kuHezekiya nezingubo eziklebhukile, bamtshela amazwi kaRabishake.",
